My work finishes at five o'clock.
I walk out of the office.
I wait at the Infopark bus stop.
The bus to the city center comes.
I get on the bus.
The bus is very crowded today.
I buy a ticket.
I do not get a seat.
After a while, we reach a big junction.
It is near my house.
The bus stops there.
I step down from the bus.
There are many shops at this junction.
I need to buy some things.
